OL,3,GNEWSARising costs having 'massive
OL,4,Aimpact' on farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FChugg warned global conflicts had
OL,7,Fcaused "a massive impact on our input
OL,8,Fprices for growing crops and food" and
OL,9,Fthe NFU urged the government to use the
OL,10,Fnext Budget to strengthen food
OL,11,Fsecurity.
OL,13,FThe government has been approached for
OL,14,Fcomment.
